Available scripts:
- sh oneRoundCATOnlyProof
- sh oneRoundCATLoadProof
- sh oneRoundCATFull
- sh oneRoundCATFullStats
- sh oneRoundCATInteractive
- sh benchmark

Their named are self explanatory.

The first run of KeY4CATs IS EXPECTED to show a warning because the main folder .key4cats does not exists.
